    {
      "leftText": "Typography",
      "rightText": "Bolden is a modern, bold typeface that conveys confidence and strength. Its sturdy design reflects Fichap’s values of solidity, professionalism and adaptability.\n\nBoldline is an elegant, versatile sans-serif offering excellent readability across sizes and weights, ideal for body text, subtitles and brand communications.",
      "_template": "twoText"
