    {
      "leftText": "Colour variants",
      "rightText": "Fichap's colour palette is designed to offer flexibility and cohesion across every brand application.\n\nEach core colour comes with primary, secondary, tertiary and quaternary shades, with lighter and darker tones at every level, keeping designs versatile without losing consistency.",
